{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The Tab bar is a system navigation component with a position which can vary depending to the OS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The tab bar can be found at the bottom of the screen for iOS. It can vary for iPadOS.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It allows users to switch between the sections of an app.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each tab can be represented by a label, optionally paired with an icon, and maintains persistent visibility across top-level destinations.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTabBar"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Content"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Appearances","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 26 brings Liquid Glass, the new Apple look and feel which will prevent developers to define specific styles for some critical components like bars."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because today the OUDS tab bar relies on native component and is not designed from scratch, some elements will look different between iOS 26 and older versions:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar can be changed for iOS lower than 26"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background color of tab bar does not change since iOS 26"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"normal \/ unselected tab item color can be changed for both image and text only for iOS lower than 26"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"with iOS 26 no token of color are applied on unselected \/ normal tab item because only the image will be changed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and not the text making theme not readable in dark color scheme"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition the badges colors will be the same and cannot be changed (except with token definition). These particular badges do not rely on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeCount","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", the native API is used instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because Liquid Glass is available since iOS 26, the tab bar will be liquified \/ glassified since this OS version, not before."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if an app is built with Xcode 26 and the flag "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YES"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", then Liquid Glass won’t be applied but the alternative layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nevertheless with Xcode 27 and for iOS 27, Liquid Glass will be always applied, whatever the value of the flag is."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you use SF Symbols for images, if they exist their "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"fill"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" variant will be automatically used in the tab bar (native behaviour)."}]},{"text":"Platform considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This component is tailored for iOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iPadOS the tabs do not apply the fonts since iPadOS 18"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because macOS does not support UIKit and because UIKIt is used to define the style of the tab bar, there is no styling of the tab bar for macOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS with its specific UI does not apply colors on tab bars and things are glasssified"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for tvOS"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Guidelines","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Guidelines"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS guidelines recommends to:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"limit when possible the number of items to 5"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use both images and texts in tab bar items"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"use badges only when needed to avoid to have heavy tab bar"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"be sure the selected information is not only defined by the color of the tab; you may need to change the shape or the fill of the image"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if a badge must be displayed, prefer short texts. If the text is a decimal value greater than 99, prefer display “+99”"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"if decorative images are used for tab bar item, apply "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"template","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering mode on it to apply color on tabs"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your tabs embedded in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" do not contain texts but only images, add an accessibility label introducing the journey for this tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your tabs embedded in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTabBar"},{"type":"text","text":" display a badge (empty or with text), vocalize it in your tab to let users know what it is (unread messages, new things, etc)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by using accessibiltiy value"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    OUDSTabBar {","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Emails\") \/\/ The text is vocalized first","                        .accessibilityValue(\"5 unread emails\") \/\/ A value vocalized after the text","            } icon: {","                Image(systemName: \"mail\").accessibilityHidden(true)","            }","        }","        .badge(5) \/\/ The value you give to the badge","    }",""]},{"text":"Selection of tabs","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Selection-of-tabs"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS lower than 26, a selected tab indicator is displayed in the "},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ; the "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter must be defined (to the number of tabs in the component),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and if the "},{"code":"selectedTab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" binding value is equal to a given tag associated to a tab item."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise the indicator won’t appear; these parameters are mandatory to compute the location of the indicator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This rule is only applied if selected tab indicator must be displayed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When the user taps a tab, the "},{"code":"selectedTab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" binding is updated automatically, keeping the parent view in sync."}]},{"text":"Technical considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Technical-considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to improve the Developer eXperience the current "},{"code":"OUDSTabBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation lets users define their own tab items."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OUDS applies only appearances and styles on elements to prevent users to define raw data to assign to the component before being rendered like a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"picker"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus users will need to add their own accessiiblity label if badges are used or also apply "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"template"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" rendering mode on images if needed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus it will be also possible to use Liquid Glass new API with animations and items stacking."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must use in your tab bar items images with "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a size of 26 x 26"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", otherwise rendering could be unaligned with Figma specifications"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the component cannot compute the ideal width of the selected tab indicator (for iOS before 26 and iPadOS before 18), ideal width based on the tab bar item content,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this indicator is not displayed for iOS lower than 26 in landscape mode and iPadOS."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app uses several universes with nested views, containing their own navigation and tab bars, prefer "},{"code":"hideTabBar()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to hide the tab bar"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"TabView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and overlay items) with Liquid Glass is disabled or not available, or also "},{"code":"tabBar(isHidden:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Use the OUDS tab bar to wrap tab bar items and associated views","    \/\/ Item tagged 0 will be selected first, 3 tabs are embedded.","    \/\/ Image with size of 26 x 26","    @State private var selectedTab = 0","","    OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: $selectedTab, count: 3) {","","        \/\/ Add the views with the SwiftUI tab item and labels","        \/\/ No need to define colors, everything is done inside OUDSTabBar","        SomeView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 1\", image: \"image_1\")","            }","            .tag(0) \/\/ Must match the selectedTab binding value","        OtherView()","            .tabItem {","                Label {","                    Text(\"Label 2\")","                } icon: {","                    Image(decorative: \"image_2\")","                        .renderingMode(.template) \/\/ Mandatory to apply color on selected item","                }","             }","            .tag(1) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","        LastView()","            .tabItem {","                Label(\"Label 3\", image: \"image_3\")","            }","            .tag(2) \/\/ Must be used for the selectedTab binding","    }"]},{"text":"Alternative components","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Alternative-components"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to use SwiftUI "},{"code":"Tab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" View with or without rules, use instead "},{"code":"OUDSTabView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you target apps with Liquid Glass enabled and need "},{"code":"Tab","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or rules, use instead "},{"code":"OUDSLiquidGlassTabView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Design documentation","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]},{"text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"text":"Liquid Glass","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Liquid-Glass"},{"text":"Orange","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Sosh","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Without Liquid Glass","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Without-Liquid-Glass"},{"text":"Orange","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Sosh","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(content:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/init(selectedTab:count:content:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/body"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/View-Implementations"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSTabBar","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTabBar","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents10OUDSTabBarV"},"references":{"component_tabBar_Sosh_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_light.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_light"},"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_dark"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark"},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png"}],"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light"},"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Wireframe_dark"},"component_tabBar_Orange_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Orange_dark.png"}],"alt":"A tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_dark"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark"},"component_tabBar_Orange_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Orange_light.png"}],"alt":"A tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Orange_light"},"https://r.orange.fr/r/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar":{"title":"unified-design-system.orange.com","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tab-bar"},"doc://OUDSComponents/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"title":"SwiftUICore.View","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSBadgeStandard":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBadgeStandard"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSBadgeStandard"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsbadgestandard","abstract":[{"text":"Badge is a UI element that emphasizes system notifications, status, or the categorization of an information, throughout colour only.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Badge is rendered as a coloured shape, without icon, text or number; and its chosen size remains unchanged regardless of the changes of the interface size."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" displays only a colored pastille."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSBadgeStandard"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode with Liquid Glass effect and Wireframe theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection","title":"Components"},"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_Sosh_dark.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in dark mode without Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_Sosh_dark"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar/body":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Uses a native SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TabView"},{"text":" populated with the given content where ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"tab item"}]},{"text":" elements are defined.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Rendering wil change depending to OS version, with a top divider and a selected tab indicator for legacy layouts.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbar\/body","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar\/body","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"body"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Sosh theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light.png"}],"alt":"A  tab bar component in light mode without Liquid Glass effect and Orange Compact theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_OrangeCompact_light"},"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light.png"}],"alt":"A tab bar component in light mode with Liquid Glass effect and Orange theme","type":"image","identifier":"component_tabBar_LiquidGlass_Orange_light"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSTabBar/View-Implementations":{"typ